#: proton_drive_desktop/app.py:3101
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Official CLI 0.8.0 cannot FUSE-mount Drive and has no Activity log. Enable "
"keeps a real local directory in sync with a chosen /my-files path (or "
"subtree) via a niced filesystem download/upload worker, starts that worker "
"now, and turns on session autostart so it stays on after login. Default "
"direction is bidirectional; upload-only or download-only run one half of the "
"pass. Default conflict policy is skip files / merge folders; rename keeps "
"both file copies with a unique suffix. Existing files are never replaced or "
"removed. Worker, last pass, and errors below come from this app's worker "
"lock and ~/.config/proton-drive-desktop/sync-status.json."
msgstr ""
"官方命令行 0.8.0 无法通过 FUSE 挂载云盘，也没有活动日志。启用后会通过降低优先"
"级的文件系统下载/上传进程，将真实本地目录与 /my-files 保持 skip/merge 同步，"
"立即启动该进程，并打开会话自动启动以便登录后继续运行。现有文件永远不会被替"
"换。下方的进程、上次同步和错误来自本应用的进程锁和 ~/.config/proton-drive-"
"desktop/sync-status.json。"

